mmit is a single-parent commit (not a merge), so no sub-commit prerequisite ambiguity. No generated or binary files. Difficulty MEDIUM only because of the test-file API adaptation; the core fix itself is EASY. Verify with the targeted tests listed above in addition to crate-mvn test-compile / crate-mvn test."
